  "re-enter password": "再次输入密码",
  "\"Suzerain\" is a work of fiction and any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental. While the game may illustrate various perspectives on political subjects, these depictions are purely for artistic exploration and do not indicate an endorsement or promotion of these viewpoints by the creators. \n\nThis game employs mature themes including instances of violence, death and suicide as part of its narrative.": "《Suzerain》是一部虚构作品，与现实中的任何在世或已故人物、真实事件如有雷同，纯属巧合。游戏可能呈现对各类政治议题的不同视角，但这些描绘仅出于艺术探索，并不代表创作者认可或宣扬这些观点。\n\n本游戏包含成熟主题，其叙事涉及暴力、死亡与自杀等情节。",
  "- 20,000 HOS employees lost their jobs.\n- More than 8000 people were arrested under charges for assisting Young Sords.\n- Half a million women joined the workforce.\n- 50,000 soldiers became unemployed.\n- 238 people were killed.\n- More than a million workers secured their rights under the new Workers Rights Act.\n- Bludish crime decreased by 60%.\n- Half a million women joined the workforce.\n- 50,000 soldiers became unemployed.\n- 238 people were killed.\n- More than a million workers secured their rights under the new Workers Rights Act.\n- Bludish crime decreased by 60%.": "- 2 万名索德兰之心员工失业。\n- 8000 多人因协助民族青年而被捕。\n- 50 万名女性进入职场。\n- 5 万名士兵失业。\n- 238 人丧生。\n- 100 多万名工人依据新的《工人权利法》获得了自己的权利。\n- 布尔德犯罪率下降了 60%。\n- 50 万名女性进入职场。\n- 5 万名士兵失业。\n- 238 人丧生。\n- 100 多万名工人依据新的《工人权利法》获得了自己的权利。\n- 布尔德犯罪率下降了 60%。",
  "Anton Rayne has been elected the 4th President of Sordland amidst a deep recession, demands for reform and external pressures. \r\n\r\nAs the United Sordland Party's candidate in 1954, he inherits a nation at a crucial turning point in its history.": "安东·雷恩在严重的经济衰退、改革呼声与外部压力之下，当选为索德兰第四任总统。\r\n\r\n作为统一索德兰党 1954 年的候选人，他接手的是一个正处于历史关键转折点的国家。",
  "Benfi, nicknamed “The Jewel of Gruni”, is the 7th biggest and 3rd wealthiest city in Republic of Sordland. It is located in the south-eastern region of Gruni by the Ves Sea. \r\n\r\nIt is internationally renowned for its beaches and wine, and very popular as a cheaper alternative to the luxurious coasts of Lespia. It produces 1/5 of Sordland’s tourism income alone.": "本菲被称为“格鲁尼的明珠”，是索德兰共和国第七大、第三富裕的城市。它位于格鲁尼地区东南部，濒临维斯海。\r\n\r\n它以海滩与葡萄酒闻名于世，作为莱斯皮亚奢华海岸的平价替代选择深受欢迎。仅它一地就贡献了索德兰五分之一的旅游收入。",
  "The Crown orders the establishment of a state-of-the-art bomber jet factory in Jales, within Brenas province. Specializing in the production of advanced bombers, the facility will significantly enhance the Kingdom’s offensive air capabilities. These bombers are designed for precision strikes on both land and sea targets, ensuring strategic dominance in future operations.\n\nThis decree strengthens the Kingdom’s military power, focusing on long-range strike capabilities and operational flexibility.": "王室下令在布雷纳斯省的贾莱斯建造一座尖端轰炸机工厂。该设施将专注于生产先进轰炸机，旨在增强王国的空中进攻能力。生产的机型具备对陆海目标的精确打击能力，确保在未来的行动中占据战略优势。\n\n该法令通过聚焦远程打击能力与作战灵活性，全面强化王国军事实力。",
  "The criteria for the allocation of public funds shall no longer be according to the number of votes won in the general election by a political party. The new criteria shall be the proportion of seats won by a political party in the Assembly. Political parties shall receive an annual amount of 500.000 ren per Member of Assembly.\n\n\n(This results in a doubling of the USP election budget and a slight increase in the other parties in the Assembly while effectively removing all funding from parties that are below the 10% election threshold.)": "公共资金的分配标准将不再依据政党在大选中获得的票数，而是依据政党在议会中所获席位的比例。每个政党将按每名议员每年 50 万索德兰元的标准获得拨款。\n\n\n（这将使统一索德兰党的竞选经费翻倍，并小幅增加议会中其他政党的经费，同时实际上取消所有得票低于 10% 选举门槛的政党的资金。）",
  "The nationalist general who led a military coup and declared martial law in 1927.": "1927 年领导军事政变并宣布戒严的民族主义将军。",
  "The new constitution will allow for the Assembly to override a veto only with a 2/3 (66%) supermajority.": "新宪法将规定：议会只有获得 2/3（66%）的绝对多数，才能推翻否决。",
  "Excavation of Topes Ancient Rezenid City": "托佩斯古城发掘",
