  "Note: Certain unit types have advantages or disadvantages on certain terrain. E.g. Mountaineer Units do best on mountain tiles.": "注意：某些单位类型在特定地形上具有优势或劣势。例如，山地师单位在山地地块上表现最佳。",
  "Note: If the attack value <sprite name=\"attack\"> of the attacker and the defence value <sprite name=\"defence\"> of the defender are equal, the attacker gets a disadvantage of -1.": "注意：如果进攻方的攻击值 <sprite name=\"attack\"> 与防守方的防御值 <sprite name=\"defence\"> 相等，进攻方将受到 -1 的劣势。",
  "Note: Naval Units can move to any free sea tile with just one action point.": "注意：海军单位只需一点行动点，即可移动到任意空闲的海域地块。",
  "<b>Support the Land battle with your Naval Unit</b>, by clicking on the Military Ship adjacent to the battle and clicking on the defender of the fight.": "<b>用你的海军单位支援陆地战斗</b>：点击与战斗相邻的军舰，再点击这场战斗中的防守方。",
  "Click \"End Turn\" to see how the battle plays out.": "点击“结束回合”，查看战斗如何展开。",
  "End the turn to see the battle play out.": "结束回合，查看战斗如何展开。",
  "Enter the Sandbox Tutorial, and try your luck at capturing the enemy city.": "进入沙盒教程，试试你能否攻下敌方城市。",
  "Every action will spend an <b>Action Point</b> <sprite name=\"actionpoint\">. The number of Action Points is determined by previous game decisions.": "每次行动都会消耗一点<b>行动点</b> <sprite name=\"actionpoint\">。行动点的数量取决于之前的游戏决策。",
  "If you have <b>Action Points left</b>, but don't want to start a new battle, it might prove useful to position your units for the next turn, fortify them to get a defence bonus, or deploy new units.": "如果你还有<b>剩余的行动点</b>，但不想发起新的战斗，不妨为下一回合调整单位的位置、让它们固守以获得防御加成，或者部署新的单位。",
  "Naval Units can disengage from a fight to reposition themselves or to flee. Try disengaging from the battle by clicking on the player Submarine and moving it away.": "海军单位可以脱离战斗，以重新调整位置或撤退。请尝试点击玩家的潜艇并将其移开，从而脱离战斗。",
  "Several enemy units have joined the fight to <b>support the battle</b>. Their support value <sprite name=\"support\"> is added to the defending unit's defence value <sprite name=\"defence\"> resulting in a potential loss of organization points <sprite name=\"organization\">.": "多个敌方单位加入了战斗，<b>支援这场战斗</b>。它们的支援值 <sprite name=\"support\"> 会加到防守单位的防御值 <sprite name=\"defence\"> 上，可能导致组织度 <sprite name=\"organization\"> 受损。",
  "Support the <b>Naval Battle</b> by moving the player Submarine to an adjacent tile and clicking on the defending unit to join the battle.": "将玩家的潜艇移动到相邻地块，并点击防守单位加入战斗，以支援<b>海战</b>。",
  "Support the battle again by selecting the player Submarine and clicking on the player Military Ship to enter the battle.": "再次支援战斗：选中玩家的潜艇，然后点击玩家的军舰进入战斗。",
  "Supporting with only one unit isn't enough to tip the scales. Try <b>supporting with another unit</b>.": "只用一个单位支援还不足以扭转局势。请尝试<b>再用另一个单位支援</b>。",
  "To <b>start a battle</b>, select the Mountaineer and click on the enemy Tank to attack <sprite name=\"attack\">.": "要<b>发起战斗</b>，请选中山地师，并点击敌方坦克进行攻击 <sprite name=\"attack\">。",
  "To attack <sprite name=\"attack\"> an enemy unit, the player unit needs to be <b>moved to an adjacent tile</b>. Try selecting the Mountaineer unit and clicking on the tile adjacent to the enemy Tank unit.": "要攻击 <sprite name=\"attack\"> 敌方单位，玩家单位需要<b>移动到相邻的地块</b>。请尝试选中山地师单位，然后点击与敌方坦克单位相邻的地块。",
  "To get the upper hand in this fight, try <b>supporting the battle</b> with adjacent player units. Select a unit and click either on the attacking unit or defending unit to support the battle.": "要在这场战斗中占据上风，请尝试让相邻的玩家单位<b>支援战斗</b>。选中一个单位，然后点击进攻单位或防守单位即可支援战斗。",
  "Fort Level 1": "要塞 1 级",
  "Fort Level 2": "要塞 2 级"
